sequenceDiagram
    participant CLI as npm start
    participant Orch as orchestrate.ts
    participant Master as OrchestratorAgent
    participant Groq as Groq (LLM)
    participant Worker as Skill Agent (Nav/Assert)
    participant MCP as Playwright MCP Client
    participant Browser as Chromium Browser

    CLI->>Orch: tsx orchestrate.ts
    Orch->>Master: Initialize & load DEMO_GOAL
    Master->>Groq: Who should handle this task?
    Groq-->>Master: Select Navigator Agent
    Master->>Worker: Delegate task
    Worker->>Groq: What MCP tool to call?
    Groq-->>Worker: Tool: playwright_navigate
    Worker->>MCP: Execute tool via stdio
    MCP->>Browser: page.goto()
    Browser-->>MCP: Page loaded
    MCP-->>Worker: Tool result
    Worker-->>Master: AgentResult (Success)
    Master-->>Orch: Task completed
